{"hash": "954ad8ab435779c8", "text": "Thanks, June. Where is this heading, going by this year's moves? Fewer modes: one agent that decides whether to answer or to work. Agents that keep running on their own computers in the cloud. And curating the desk, instead of only making it bigger. Beyond that, nobody knows yet. Safe to ignore for now: version numbers, leaderboards, and the maths inside the model. Three things to keep. The model only knows what's on its desk right now. Memory and instruction files are text put back on the desk, and a fuller desk is a worse desk. Making pictures is mostly a hand-off. It reads many kinds of input, but pictures, video and music usually come from a separate model, most often diffusion. Same model, many rooms, four meters. Where you meet it changes what it can touch and what it costs, and a warm cache makes repeats cheap.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "n", "k", "s", ",", " ", "J", "u", "n", "e", ".", " ", "W", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "h", "e", "a", "d", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "g", "o", "i", "n", "g", " ", "b", "y", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "'", "s", " ", "m", "o", "v", "e", "s", "?", " ", "F", "e", "w", "e", "r", " ", "m", "o", "d", "e", "s", ":", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "a", "g", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "d", "e", "c", "i", "d", "e", "s", " ", "w", "h", "e", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", " ", "o", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", ".", " ", "A", "g", "e", "n", "t", "s", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "k", "e", "e", "p", " ", "r", "u", "n", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "c", "o", "m", "p", "u", "t", "e", "r", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "l", "o", "u", "d", ".", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "c", "u", "r", "a", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "e", "s", "k", ",", " ", "i", "n", "s", "t", "